/-!
# Short witnesses for large Mathieu involution generation

Three conjugates of the marked M23 involution, and four conjugates of each
marked M24 involution, recover the native generators from `Generators`.
All words and point tables here are untrusted data; `Certificates` checks
every identity in Lean. See `source/README.md` for reconstruction details.

Source: Guralnick--Malle, *Classification of 2F-modules I*, (2.5)--(2.6)
and Proposition 5.1, manuscript pp.4,16--17.
-/

